&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with Huge’s Global Growth team, Marketing and Communications, Alliances, senior client partners, and practice leaders to build pipeline and convert it into revenue.&amp;nbsp;Success is measured by qualified pipeline generated, new business won, and revenue closed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate new business.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a prioritized EMEA target account strategy, using Huge’s ideal client profile, market signals, and buying triggers to focus on the opportunities most likely to convert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Originate opportunities through direct outreach, senior relationships, referrals, industry events, and partner channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with CMOs, CDOs, CTOs, and other decision-makers to uncover business challenges before they become formal briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
